    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cot</mi><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cosec</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cot</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>cot</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>cosec</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cosec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cot</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>cosec</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cot</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cosec</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cot</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cosec</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cot</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp;is the constant of integration.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>log</mi><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p>",
